{"text":"MODEL_FEEDBACK_JSON:
{
  "positive_alignment_reasons": [
    "The stainless worm gear hose clamps closely match items I have bought repeatedly, so they feel relevant for similar repairs when the size fits.",
    "The epoxy fits my use of duct tape and vinyl cement: I am interested in practical ways to make durable repairs."
  ],
  "negative_misalignment_reasons": [
    "The nuts and threaded inserts require a particular size and repair need; doing general repairs does not give me a reason to buy them now.",
    "Cutting wheels and a temperature gun serve tasks I have not shown a need for, while ten tubes of super glue exceed what I would choose for occasional use."
  ],
  "overgeneralized_signals": [
    "My repair purchases seem to have been taken as interest in almost any workshop supply, including specialized fasteners and metal-cutting tools.",
    "My inspection camera purchase seems to have been stretched into interest in other measuring equipment, although a temperature gun solves a different problem."
  ],
  "missing_or_underweighted_signals": [
    "Repeated purchases of adjustable stainless hose clamps say more about what I might need again than a single purchase of inspection equipment.",
    "I choose supplies for specific jobs, so matching dimensions, usable quantities, and an actual task matter. Electrical cleaner is relevant to my maintenance interests, but I would still wait for a cleaning need."
  ],
  "summary_diagnosis": "The recommendations recognize my practical repair interests but assume too readily that related workshop supplies meet a current need."
}"}
